WEBVTT

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:51.530
Elis? I'm coming in.

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:53.860
Looks like you're hard at work.

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:55.510
I brought you some onigiri.

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:59.040
Are you submitting that painting
to the competition?

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:04.870
Why don't you use some red here?

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:10.270
If you're going to continue painting,
you should start using some red...

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.940
I know. You don't have to tell me.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:15.470
Right.

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:17.960
Get some rest.

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:32.360
Sentimental Lazuline

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:30.260
These are good.

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:38.240
Kikyo Kiri

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.550
Hello?

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:47.910
You're still awake?

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:49.090
Yeah.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:58.540
I was wondering if you'd like the civil servant
exams practice problems I used.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:00.630
That would help.

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:03.660
Really? I'll bring them to
school tomorrow, then.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.860
I could go get them.

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:07.550
You mean right now?

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:09.030
Well, it's already too late today...

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:13.170
You're right.

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:18.660
Kiri? What happened?

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:21.560
The fluorescent light went out.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:22.750
I think it's dead.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.580
What am I going to do?
I didn't buy a spare.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.190
Is it one of those ring ones?

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:28.020
We've got one here. Do you
want me to bring it over?

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.960
I don't know if it'll fit, though.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:34.790
I guess there's no harm in bringing it.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.900
I'll stop by someplace near you. Is
there anywhere we can meet?

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:41.690
Well, there's a family restaurant nearby.

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.820
You know, the one at the intersection
on third street.

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:44.570
Got it.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.570
Fluorescent Light Bulb

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:59.500
5000 Japanese Teaching
Examination Problems

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:01.160
Thanks.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.670
No, thank you.

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:05.920
How is Elis-chan?

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:10.140
She's busy painting her submission to a
competition hosted by a newspaper.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:10.960
Really...

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.720
We should order something.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:17.820
The menu...

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:22.510
Why's your hair wet?

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:26.440
I was in a hurry to dry it.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.880
You didn't need to rush.

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.400
Are you stupid?

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:36.320
You're right. There was no
need to hurry, but...

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:42.260
We aren't in high school or in Hokkaido.
Meeting you here is just...

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.410
It just seems weird.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:47.830
What's weird about it?

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.700
Do you always have to say something?

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:52.140
It's because you're always
spouting nonsense.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.650
We make a good team, don't we?

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:55.660
What are we, a comedy group?

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:04.020
This is fun.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:06.950
Spending time with you.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:22.700
Elis, you're still up?

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:25.040
Onii-chan, where were you off to?

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:27.290
A family restaurant.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:28.940
At this time of night?

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:31.110
You were studying.

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.540
Uh, yeah.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:36.480
I'm going to bed.

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:38.780
You should get some sleep, too.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:42.720
The new semester starts
tomorrow. Later.

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.610
Good night.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.090
Good night.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.290
Good morning, Hosen-san.
You're here early.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.440
Good morning.

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:02.450
Is that a new painting?

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:03.110
Yes.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:08.700
A brilliant light on a lazuline
background...

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.540
This painting is just like you.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:13.990
It's like a hard, green fruit
that hasn't ripened yet.

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:16.750
You don't like it?

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:21.610
I wanted to use red, but...

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.080
I couldn't do it.

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.530
Don't worry about that.

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:28.620
It's both wavering and bold.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.070
Your painting has a unique appeal.

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.270
It's a good painting.

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:33.970
You really are amazing.

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.970
Thank you for saying that.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:39.130
You're submitting this to
the contest, aren't you?

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:39.880
Yes.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:42.950
This might do pretty well.

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:47.290
I'll try putting myself on a canvas, too.

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:49.290
Don't think I'll lose to you.

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:51.090
I couldn't wish for more.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:55.690
...and that's the plan for
the second semester.

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:58.460
You'll begin taking more electives...

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:01.980
so be sure to carefully consider the content
and time of all your courses.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.240
Elis-chan. Hey, Elis-chan.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.560
Students taking art electives.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:08.550
Yes.

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:10.580
Hey, Hosen. Wake up!

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:15.460
Hosen-san, summer vacation is over.

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:19.050
Ow.

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:21.990
I'm sorry to summon you here.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:22.920
Not at all...

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:26.840
You received an A for your
student teaching.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:32.930
Shinomiya-sensei spoke
very highly of you.

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:35.240
Thank you.

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:39.600
Are you hoping to become a teacher
after graduating from college?

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.290
That's the plan.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:45.610
In that case, would you like a
teaching apprenticeship here?

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:50.250
After you graduate, I would
like for you to teach here.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.720
What do you think?

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:56.720
You pulled an all nighter?

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:59.390
I got caught up in my painting.

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:00.830
You must be excited about it.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.770
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:03.660
Okay.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:07.730
Delicious.

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:10.050
You shouldn't drink too much caffeine.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.740
I know.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:15.140
Onii-chan.

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:15.970
Hey.

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:18.420
Is this seat taken?

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:19.980
Can't you tell?

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:22.110
Kamikura-sensei!

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:24.660
Here.

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:25.880
What is this?

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.490
Boiled pork and eggs.

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:31.710
You really made this for me.

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:33.220
I stayed up all night after that.

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:34.760
After what?

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:37.390
We met at a family restaurant
yesterday.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:40.600
What does the restaurant have
to do with boiled pork?

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:45.060
We were talked for so long,
Hiroki got hungry.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:49.680
He said he wanted boiled pork, but
there wasn't any on the menu.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.470
So you brought him a homemade lunch.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.040
Why don't you all try some?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.080
This is delicious.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:08:59.720
Elis-chan?

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:03.990
Elis.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:07.780
What's wrong, Elis?

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.530
You liar.

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:12.530
You're a liar, Onii-chan!

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.280
Elis-chan...

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:34.340
Onii-chan has never lied to me before.

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:37.700
You don't like that he lied?

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:38.720
That's not it!

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:43.150
My chest hurts. Why does
it hurt so much?

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:44.180
Why?

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:45.800
Because...

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:47.330
Why?

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:50.070
You really don't know?

00:09:52.870 --> 00:09:56.070
Then you really are an idiot.

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:08.780
Sounds like a good deal.

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:09.830
Yeah...

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:13.210
What did you tell the superintendent?

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:16.090
I said I'd think about it.

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:19.810
Right. You're taking the
civil servant exam, too.

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:23.600
I'm thinking of taking her up on
the apprenticeship, though.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.530
Really?

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:29.270
I hope we can work together, Hiroki.

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:36.720
Where's Hosen?

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:38.080
Taking a nap.

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:46.860
Onii-chan.

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:50.830
Onii-chan.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.520
Hosen-san.

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:31.640
Is your class self studying, too?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.370
Is something wrong?

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.630
This really hurts...

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:37.840
Your stomach does?

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:40.840
Then where?

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:44.780
Onii-chan must be in
love with Kiri-san...

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:48.040
And Kiri-san...

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:49.790
I won't accept this!

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:54.560
Your heart must be hurting.

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:58.760
I want Onii-chan to look at only me.

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.750
I want him to always stay by my side.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:03.330
I love...

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.640
I don't know what to tell you.

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:11.640
You're right, Senpai.

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:13.640
I'm sorry.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:19.330
What should I do?

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:29.330
No one can hear you singing
in your heart.

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:33.960
If you want to be heard, you
have to sing out loud.

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:36.850
Out loud...

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.480
Guaranteed to grab his attention!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.480
Formulas for Winning in Love

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:47.290
Tap, tap.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:51.800
Miss, could I interest you in this?

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:53.750
Bring on the Love

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:57.740
This is a story about a girl...

00:12:57.740 --> 00:13:00.950
who finally confesses her feelings
to the boy she's always loved.

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:03.990
It's my most popular work!

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:05.200
Really?

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.580
Hey!

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:07.750
Thank you for your business!

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:09.180
I'm not buying it!

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:30.240
I'm home.

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:31.520
Elis?

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:34.330
What?

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:36.600
Read this, Onii-chan.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:40.260
It's a book about a girl...

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:43.600
who finally confesses her feelings
to the boy she's always loved.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.200
Why would I read this?

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:49.530
Just read it! Tell me what
you think about it later!

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:52.040
Okay.

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:59.250
An Easy Guide to Writing Letters

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:02.970
If you're writing a love letter,
I'll revise it for you.

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:05.050
I happen to be a writer.

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:06.420
I'll let you know.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:09.200
Did you learn anything from my novel?

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:11.150
I cried.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:16.430
When the protagonist finally says
the words she could never say.

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:22.010
“I didn't realize how I felt at first.”

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:27.950
“But eventually, all I could
think about was you.”

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:31.730
“I've always loved you.”

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:36.700
“I've always loved you.”

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:41.090
Onii-chan, did you read it?

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.290
Huh? Yeah.

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:44.730
What did you think?

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.230
What did I think?

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:51.340
What did you think of the
protagonist's confession?

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:54.340
Huh? Well...

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:56.590
I thought she should have
said something earlier.

00:14:57.400 --> 00:14:58.990
What's that supposed to mean?

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:00.620
I mean, don't you agree?

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:04.980
If you like someone, they won't
know unless you tell them.

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:07.720
Then...

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:12.660
What did you think of a girl
confessing her feelings?

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.560
I think it's a good thing.

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:22.000
Kiri-san confessed to you, didn't she?

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:25.440
I'm speaking in general terms.

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:28.980
Let's leave the review at that, all right?

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:32.480
Hey.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:35.960
Just for a little bit.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.200
You're impossible.

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:41.300
Oh, that's right. Did you finish
your contest submission?

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:43.350
I did. I already sent it in.

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:45.460
Without showing me?

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:49.660
Your mind's full of thoughts of Kiri-san.

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:53.610
What? That's not...

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:57.600
Well, I hope you win.

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:01.140
If I win...

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:04.270
I wonder if something
good with happen.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:06.460
Something good?

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.210
That's...

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.060
Elis?

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.730
What'd you look this way for?

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:25.200
I'm going to sleep!

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.200
Good night!

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:44.470
If I win, I wonder if I'll be able
to confess my feelings.

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:54.790
A special incentive award was
given to one of our students.

00:16:58.840 --> 00:17:00.700
Hosen-san, it's you.

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.850
Congratulations, Hosen-san!

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:05.040
My painting...

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:08.790
Takeuchi-san, you received
an honorable mention.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.440
Congratulations to the both of you.

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:12.210
Thank you.

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:15.730
Tomorrow afternoon, there will
be an award ceremony.

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:19.600
Hosen-san, you will also be receiving
an additional prize.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:24.650
It is a year abroad at an
art school in Paris.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.590
That's amazing!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:28.860
Paris...

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:47.140
Congratulations, Elis.

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:52.080
You'll get to study art in the
place your mother was born.

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:56.520
Auntie Anna must be pleased.

00:17:58.020 --> 00:18:00.680
Hurry home. I'm waiting for you.

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:05.900
Welcome home.

00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:08.710
What's wrong? Are you tired?

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:10.830
No, but...

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:13.730
You must be anxious.

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:15.270
Hurry up and change.

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:28.830
Welcome home!

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:30.370
Congratulations, Elis!

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:33.790
I've prepared a great dinner for you.

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:35.260
I even baked a cake.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:38.940
This additional award sure is a surprise.

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:41.500
Today we're celebrating you, Elis-chan.

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:42.930
Eat up.

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:47.970
Elis-chan, congratulations
on your trip to Paris.

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:49.280
Sit down.

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:51.110
You're amazing, Elis-chan.

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:53.280
This looks great.

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:54.520
Shall we eat?

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:55.330
Yeah.

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:03.080
I heard you'll be studying
abroad in Paris!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:06.980
You must be delighted to have the opportunity
to study to your heart's content!

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:08.590
I'm not happy!

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:14.210
Why are you here?

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:16.610
Leave.

00:19:16.610 --> 00:19:17.270
Elis.

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:18.200
Leave!

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:25.780
I'm sorry.

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:26.740
Kiri...

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:28.820
I'll take you home.

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:30.520
I'll be fine.

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:38.060
Sorry about that...

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:39.590
Don't worry about it.

00:19:39.590 --> 00:19:40.510
But...

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:41.190
See you later.

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:41.930
Okay.

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.610
Elis, let's eat.

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:05.620
When I'm gone, will Kiri-san come
here every day to cook?

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:06.550
Elis.

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:10.220
When I'm gone, will you and Kiri-san...

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:12.260
Elis, what are you talking about?

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:15.560
Is Kiri-san more important to you?

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:32.820
Are you fine without me?

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:34.580
Elis...

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:42.390
Paris is far from here. We won't
see each other for along time.

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:47.590
I don't want this.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:52.730
I don't want to leave you!

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:19.880
I... I...

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:25.000
I love you, Onii-chan!

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.370
Snow white is a pure white color.

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:15.410
A color so cold, it'll freeze.

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:16.810
Hey, Onii-chan...

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:19.840
How does it feel to turn down a girl who
has confessed her feelings for you?

00:23:19.840 --> 00:23:25.350
Huh? Well, I guess I'd feel
sorry for hurting her.

00:23:25.350 --> 00:23:26.340
That's all?

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:28.980
It would be kind of a waste.

00:23:28.980 --> 00:23:32.420
I'd hope she wouldn't be too persistent
or hate me, either.

00:23:32.420 --> 00:23:34.060
That makes sense.

00:23:34.060 --> 00:23:36.810
Next Episode, “Snow White
Recollections.”

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:39.120
Don't go too far for love!
